<title>POLAND: GDANSKI JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 9.27 MLN.</title>
<headline>GDANSKI JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 9.27 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  9.27 vs   12.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   14.75 vs   16.51</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 31.85 vs   36.14</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	72.55 vs   64.53</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 59.96 vs   55.34</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   89.96 vs   89.58</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		208.73 vs  196.78</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     424.15 vs  361.34</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
